sequenceDiagram
    actor desktop_owner
    participant UI as Tauri UI
    participant Engine as User Rust engine
    participant Journal as User SQLite journal
    participant Service as Existing backup service
    participant Target as Target database
    desktop_owner->>UI: Explicit reviewed Apply
    UI->>Engine: edit.apply with attempt identity
    Engine->>Service: workbench.binding.authorize
    Service-->>Engine: Canonical descriptor revision and observed work
    Engine->>Journal: Commit admission and dispatch intent
    Engine->>Target: BEGIN standalone transaction
    alt Update or delete
        Engine->>Target: Lock read typed originals then bound conditional mutation
        Target-->>Engine: Original match and certified matched-row effect
    else Insert without existing rowHandle
        Engine->>Target: Bound ordinary INSERT with reviewed defaults
        Target-->>Engine: Certified single-row insert effect or refusal
    end
    alt Basis count or mutation effect rejected
        Engine->>Target: ROLLBACK
        alt Rollback confirmed
            Target-->>Engine: Supported transactional effects rolled back
            Engine->>Journal: rolled_back and preserved conflict evidence
        else Rollback disposition unproven
            Engine->>Journal: outcome_unknown and no automatic replay
        end
    else Every mutation effect certified
        Engine->>Service: Fresh workbench.binding.authorize for COMMIT
        alt Authority denied stale or unavailable
            Service-->>Engine: Refuse COMMIT
            Engine->>Target: ROLLBACK cleanup still permitted
            alt Rollback confirmed
                Target-->>Engine: Rollback confirmed
                Engine->>Journal: rolled_back without sending COMMIT
            else Rollback disposition unproven
                Engine->>Journal: outcome_unknown and no automatic replay
            end
        else Fresh COMMIT authority valid
            Service-->>Engine: Current revision and conflict validation
            Engine->>Journal: Persist commit_requested
            Engine->>Target: COMMIT
            alt Positive commit evidence
                Target-->>Engine: Commit confirmed
                Engine->>Journal: Atomic committed and state_version
                Engine-->>UI: Version hint
            else Target proves rollback
                Target-->>Engine: Rollback confirmed
                Engine->>Journal: Atomic rolled_back and state_version
            else Reply lost or process exits
                Engine->>Journal: outcome_unknown on recovery
            end
        end
    end
    UI->>Engine: operation.get
    Engine-->>UI: Observed outcome and no automatic replay
